        "value": "?"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s04.mp3",
      "duration": 5.98
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "line": "Right now, you'd probably guess something low. A four. Maybe a five, if you were lucky.",
      "set": "void",
      "shot": "lineup",
      "others": [
        "maya"
      ],
      "nameTags": true,
      "label": "a secret score",
      "expression": {
        "you": "nervous"
      },
      "counter": {
        "label": "your guess",
        "value": 4
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s05.mp3",
      "duration": 6.92
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "line": "But in 2018, a group of psychologists decided to actually check.",
      "set": "classroom",
      "shot": "wide",
      "crowd": 10,
      "badge": "2018",
      "expression": {
        "you": "neutral"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s06.mp3",
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "line": "They brought strangers into a lab, paired them up, and simply let them talk.",
      "set": "classroom",
      "shot": "twoshot",
      "others": [
        "jake"
      ],
      "expression": {
        "you": "nervous>happy",
        "jake": "neutral>happy"
      },
      "action": {
        "jake": "nod"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s07.mp3",
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "line": "Afterwards, each person answered two questions.",
      "set": "void",
      "shot": "lineup",
      "others": [
        "jake"
      ],
      "nameTags": true,
      "label": "two questions",
      "sfx": [
        "pop"
      ],
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s08.mp3",
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "line": "How much did you like your partner? And how much do you think they liked you?",
      "set": "void",
      "shot": "lineup",
      "others": [
        "jake"
      ],
      "nameTags": true,
      "label": "two questions",
      "expression": {
        "you": "smug>nervous"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s09.mp3",
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "line": "And almost everyone made the same mistake.",
      "set": "hall",
      "shot": "closeup",
      "crowd": 30,
      "expression": {
        "you": "surprised"
      },
      "sfx": [
        "thud"
      ],
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s10.mp3",
      "duration": 3.81
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "line": "People consistently underestimated how much their partner actually liked them.",
      "set": "void",
      "shot": "lineup",
      "crowd": 8,
      "label": "the liking gap",
      "sfx": [
        "riser"
      ],
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s11.mp3",
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "line": "Their partner had enjoyed the conversation far more than they realised.",
      "set": "classroom",
      "shot": "ots",
      "others": [
        "jake"
      ],
      "crowd": 10,
      "expression": {
        "you": "nervous",
        "jake": "happy"
      },
      "action": {
        "jake": "wave"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s12.mp3",
      "duration": 5.09
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "line": "The researchers called it the liking gap. And it didn't just happen once.",
      "set": "hall",
      "shot": "overhead",
      "crowd": 40,
      "badge": "the liking gap",
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s13.mp3",
      "duration": 5.98
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "line": "It showed up across five different studies.",
      "set": "hall",
      "shot": "dolly",
      "crowd": 46,
      "badge": "5 studies",
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s14.mp3",
      "duration": 3.42
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "line": "In short chats of just two minutes. And in long ones of forty-five.",
      "set": "street",
      "shot": "wide",
      "others": [
        "maya",
        "jake"
      ],
      "crowd": 10,
      "badge": "2 to 45 minutes",
      "expression": {
        "maya": "happy",
        "jake": "smug"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s15.mp3",
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "line": "It even showed up in first-year college students getting to know their new dorm mates.",
      "set": "classroom",
      "shot": "overhead",
      "crowd": 20,
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s16.mp3",
      "duration": 5.17
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "line": "Men or women, it made no difference. The gap was there for both.",
      "set": "void",
      "shot": "lineup",
      "others": [
        "maya",
        "jake"
      ],
      "crowd": 4,
      "label": "men and women",
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s17.mp3",
      "duration": 5.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "line": "So why does your brain get this so wrong?",
      "set": "bedroom",
      "shot": "closeup",
      "expression": {
        "you": "sleepy>nervous"
      },
      "sfx": [
        "whoosh"
      ],
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s18.mp3",
      "duration": 3.73
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "line": "Because after a conversation, you replay your own worst moments.",
      "set": "bedroom",
      "shot": "wide",
      "expression": {
        "you": "nervous"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s19.mp3",
      "duration": 5.33
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "line": "The awkward pause. The joke that didn't land. The thing you wish you hadn't said.",
      "set": "bedroom",
      "shot": "closeup",
      "expression": {
        "you": "nervous"
      },
      "counter": {
        "label": "bad moments",
        "value": 3
      },
      "sfx": [
        "tick"
      ],
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s20.mp3",
      "duration": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "line": "In the studies, the more negative thoughts people had about a conversation, the bigger their liking gap.",
      "set": "void",
      "shot": "lineup",
      "crowd": 6,
      "label": "negative thoughts",
      "expression": {
        "you": "nervous"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s21.mp3",
      "duration": 7.18
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "line": "But the other person never saw those moments the way you did.",
      "set": "hall",
      "shot": "twoshot",
      "others": [
        "maya"
      ],
      "crowd": 20,
      "expression": {
        "you": "nervous",
        "maya": "happy"
      },
      "audio": "voice/the-liking-gap/s22.mp3",
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "line": "And chances are, they were walking away doing the exact same thing.",
      "set": "street",
      "shot": "follow",
      "crowd": 8,
      "action": {
        "you": "walk"
      },
      "expression": {
